  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I write a short summary for the team. I explain the private vulnerability report to a new teammate. We discuss the risk around the patched version. I document the antivirus software so the team can review it later. I update immediately and then explain the risk. Priya checks with me, \"Could you freeze the card?\" I answer clearly, \"Please send me a confirmation.\" We update the dependency. The alert is resolved.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I write a short summary for the team. I explain the private vulnerability report to a new teammate. We discuss the risk around the patched version. I document the antivirus software so the team can review it later. I update immediately and then explain the risk. Priya checks with me, \"Could you freeze the card?\" I answer clearly, \"Please send me a confirmation.\" We update the dependency. The alert is resolved.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我给团队写了一份简短的总结。我向一位新队友解释了私密漏洞报告。我们讨论了已修复版本相关的风险。我把杀毒软件写成文档，方便团队之后查看。我立即更新，然后解释了风险。Priya向我确认：\"你能冻结这张卡吗？\"我清楚地回答：\"请给我发送确认信息。\"我们更新了依赖。警报解除了。",
   "hard": [
